According to your suggestion, I changed my simulation code and it won't generate error. My simulation includes 3 players and for each players we have 5 observations and 2 columns of  covariates.
My code is as follows:

x11 <- rnorm(5)
x12 <- rnorm(5)
x13 <- rnorm(5)
x21 <- rnorm(5)
x22 <- rnorm(5)
x23 <- rnorm(5)
